## Maintenance and change history

Support contact: FortONNX project maintainers<br>
Deprecation policy: follows the source example containing the builder<br>
Change classification: initial example package

Changes to graph bytes, tensor meaning, formula, verification values, or
required artifacts require a different example package version. This package
does not change the FortONNX project release version.
